        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Ripgrep also supports an rc file which you can globally ignore certain files/filetypes or folders with: https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/blob/master/GUIDE.md#configuration-file\r\n\r\nExample how I do it in .ripgreprc:\r\n```\r\n# Exclude directories.\r\n--glob=!{.git,.svn,node_modules}\r\n\r\n# Exclude file types.\r\n--iglob=!*.{~sql}\r\n``` ",
